                                                "sense_id": "77930ea7-6ad5-3686-9cc2-5e150e0d22f7",
                                                "text": "Now I’m looking at a flashback Sunday.\nZoom lens feelings just won’t disappear.\nClose-up darkroom sweet-talk in my ear."
